<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114535" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοῦς</span></b>  (B), ὁ, also ἡ
		<i><span class="en">
			Str.
			10.2.19
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			12.8.17
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			16.1.9
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>soil excavated</i> or <i>heaped
				up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ χ. ὁ ἐξορυχθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.150
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν αἰεὶ ἐξορυσσόμενον χοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.185
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				121
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.380.26
			</span></i>, etc.: gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					2.27.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1631.28
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span> (un
				contr.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(1).691.6
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Corcyra</span>)); also (from confusion with
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοῦς</span> A) gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοός</span> LX<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				3.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				342.27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PBremen</u>
				14.13
			</span></i>; dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοΐ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3)
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				248.10
			</span></i> (Anaphe, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονιορτός</span>
			, <i>dust,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				18.38
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				6.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοῦς θανάτου</span>”
				<i>the grave,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					21(22).16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
